"实例管理：手动启动或打开指定账号；更多菜单可复制路径及管理登录保护。\n账号管理：搜索、筛选、设置本地别名，勾选后复制路径。\n项目管理：维护公共目录入口；所有写入均需明确操作。\n日志记录：筛选、搜索、翻页、导出当前结果；重启和更新后保留。\n系统设置：更改即时保存并生效，恢复默认不会处理账号数据。\n\n启动器不查询 Claude 服务、不读取凭据，不控制官方客户端自身正常联网。" = "Instances: start or open a specific account; the More menu copies paths and manages login protection.\nAccounts: search, filter, set local aliases, and copy paths of checked accounts.\nProjects: keep shared folder entries; every write needs an explicit action.\nLogs: filter, search, page and export the current results; kept across restarts and updates.\nSettings: changes are saved and applied immediately; restoring defaults never touches account data.\n\nThe launcher never queries Claude services or reads credentials, and does not control the official client's own networking.";
