"在实例页聚焦／点击，或你手动展开官方 Code 用量弹窗时，读取一次已有控件并记录。不定时轮询、不代点、不调用用量查询，不读官方历史或登录信息。必要时仅启用该官方进程的本机网页辅助功能树，不更改系统权限。弹窗关闭后保留最近周记录和原时间；重启后核对归属再恢复。卡片上的时间是本机观察时间，不是服务器实时额度，两项时间独立；账号或组织变化不沿用缓存。" = "Existing controls are read once and recorded when you focus or click the Instances page, or open the official Code usage popover yourself. No polling, no clicks on your behalf, no usage queries, and no reading of official history or sign-in data. If needed, only the local web accessibility tree of that official process is enabled; system permissions are not changed. After the popover closes, the latest weekly record and its time are kept; after a restart ownership is verified before restoring. Times on the card are local observation times, not live server quotas, and the two are independent; caches are not reused across account or organization changes.";
